    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <ol>
	<li>Once an employer submits a Finance Method Change Request, they should <b>not</b> be able to submit the request again while the request is pending. </li>
	<li>If the request is pending, the page should display a yellow warning banner with the following text:
	<ol>
		<li>"<b>This account has a pending finance change request.</b> You cannot make another until the prior request is either approved or denied."</li>
	</ol>
	</li>
	<li>The “Change Effective Year” should display in the grey box, just like it does on the confirmation page.</li>
	<li>There should <b>not</b> be a “Submit” button</li>
</ol>




<p>Screenshot is a sample mockup (created by Gayle; not Andrew/Nelnet).</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://dwd-wi.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/139263" alt="image-20261029-194014.png" width="688" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <br/>

