            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-231116"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>This should probably be worked with <a href="https://dwd-wi.atlassian.net/browse/UIEP-4030" title="smart-link" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://dwd-wi.atlassian.net/browse/UIEP-4030</a> , which is also about the Finance Method Change Request, whose mockups are documented on <a href="https://www.figma.com/design/TMov8OdJr7SVWHOoLveiKv/DWD-Portal-Concepts?node-id=20234-294301&amp;p=f" title="smart-link" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://www.figma.com/design/TMov8OdJr7SVWHOoLveiKv/DWD-Portal-Concepts?node-id=20234-294301&amp;p=f</a> </p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-231169"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="712020:ba50c93a-1082-4ba6-bd5b-57cf0a24abb3"
                id="word_commented_712020:ba50c93a-1082-4ba6-bd5b-57cf0a24abb3"
                href="https://dwd-wi.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3Aba50c93a-1082-4ba6-bd5b-57cf0a24abb3">
                    Michael Johnson
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">Oct 30, 2026</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-231169"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>We’ll need to be able to determine on page load whether a pending Finance Method Change Request exists. Devs will attend Zach’s office hours to find out if an endpoint exists that we can use to make that determination. If not, there will be some back end work required before we can meet this requirement. <a href="https://dwd-wi.atlassian.net/jira/people/team/998ededc-ed96-4dec-9387-beb444ae1310?ref=jira$&amp;src=issue" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">ERP Tag Group</a> (<a href="https://dwd-wi.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A7f1bd484-db0f-4d26-bad0-c849fc59f797" class="user-hover" rel="712020:7f1bd484-db0f-4d26-bad0-c849fc59f797" data-account-id="712020:7f1bd484-db0f-4d26-bad0-c849fc59f797" accountid="712020:7f1bd484-db0f-4d26-bad0-c849fc59f797" rel="noreferrer">Grace Konyar</a> <a href="https://dwd-wi.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A0899fb7e-27de-4aba-bd24-969b2540a1c5" class="user-hover" rel="712020:0899fb7e-27de-4aba-bd24-969b2540a1c5" data-account-id="712020:0899fb7e-27de-4aba-bd24-969b2540a1c5" accountid="712020:0899fb7e-27de-4aba-bd24-969b2540a1c5" rel="noreferrer">Shaun Meinert</a> <a href="https://dwd-wi.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A87ced96f-2dfb-46cf-8c85-5f9b0305a8ea" class="user-hover" rel="712020:87ced96f-2dfb-46cf-8c85-5f9b0305a8ea" data-account-id="712020:87ced96f-2dfb-46cf-8c85-5f9b0305a8ea" accountid="712020:87ced96f-2dfb-46cf-8c85-5f9b0305a8ea" rel="noreferrer">Heather Westley</a> <a href="https://dwd-wi.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A10ac90e7-1a7d-4d2c-8a75-b712026dff48" class="user-hover" rel="712020:10ac90e7-1a7d-4d2c-8a75-b712026dff48" data-account-id="712020:10ac90e7-1a7d-4d2c-8a75-b712026dff48" accountid="712020:10ac90e7-1a7d-4d2c-8a75-b712026dff48" rel="noreferrer">Gayle Cottrill</a> <a href="https://dwd-wi.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A2b95043f-e1ce-40db-987f-f9912471e07e" class="use